      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing, the \"spark\" is just more pain. it's not a fight anymore, it's just... dragging. i look at my life and i don't see a survivor, i just see someone who's failed at everything that matters. if i'm so \"stubborn,\" why does it feel like the only way to actually find peace is to just stop fighting? it feels like the most logical thing to do is just let go of everything. is it even wrong to want it to just be over?",
